<title>SPAIN: Spain's Treasury account fell by 185.6 bln pta.</title>
<headline>Spain's Treasury account fell by 185.6 bln pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish Treasury reduced its current account balance with the Bank of Spain in March by 185.6 billion pesetas, a statement showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>That account stood at 1.97 trillion pesetas at the end of February, down from 2.53 at December 1996.</p>
<p>The note added that in the first quarter that account has been reduced by a total of 742.7 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
